  sig=func New(cfg Config) Notifier
  doc=New builds a Notifier from cfg. ntfy (default) is added whenever a topic can\nbe determined; Apprise (optional) is added when AppriseURL is set. With both,\nthe returned Notifier fans out to each. With neither, it is a noop.
EDGES
